  "owner_text": "KEEP the Cycle-1 python_callable implementation and digest unchanged: 1961e84d... New observation classes MUST ship under a SECOND probe identity. Do not mutate the Cycle-1 probe implementation merely to add: returns_bytes; constant equality; workspace stimulus; richer raises attributes. Existing Cycle-1 ProductProofSpec / semantic_hash evidence remains tied to the original probe. The new probe must have independent: probe_id; probe_digest; capability calibration; falsifiability evidence; mutation evidence; Q1/Q2/Q3 coverage.",
  "mechanical_consequences": [
   "aisef2/probe/protocol.py and aisef2/probe/python_callable.py stay byte-identical to the parent's blobs (cycle2_baseline R2); the live digest is checked against the frozen 1961e84d… on every run",
